  "description": "CastleCon (CC) is a furry camping event in Horb am Neckar, Baden-Württemberg, Germany. The site has washing facilities, a playground and an outdoor pool, and the event is self-catering, with a barbecue grill and charcoal provided. There is room for about 80 to 100 campers and their dogs. The first CastleCon was held April 30 to May 2, 2010, organized by Caroua, Ragear, Semoy and Shippo, and attendance has ranged from about 30 to 103.",
